# Technology Subcategory Schema & Enhancement Strategy

## 📊 **Subcategory Architecture Overview**

### **Schema Structure**
- **43 subcategories** organizing 100 technologies
- **17 uncategorized technologies** (no subcategory assignment)
- **Hygraph CMS** manages technology-subcategory relationships
- **GraphQL API** for data fetching and mutations

### **Technology Schema Fields**
```graphql
type Technology {
  id: ID!
  name: String!
  slug: String!
  description: String!
  icon: String!
  priority: Int!
  stage: Stage!
  
  # Content Fields (Enhancement Targets)
  features: String                    # Comma-separated features
  businessMetrics: String            # Comma-separated metrics
  additonalDetails: String          # Detailed implementation content
  
  # Relationships
  category: [Category]               # Multiple category connections
  subcategories: [Subcategory]       # Multiple subcategory connections
  
  # System Fields
  publishedAt: DateTime
  updatedAt: DateTime!
  createdAt: DateTime!
}
```

